1ved|a|of Set ; Fixed in position; immovable; rigid; as, a set line; a set countenance. ; Firm; unchanging; obstinate; as, set opinions or prejudices. ; Regular; uniform; formal; as, a set discourse; a set battle. ; Established; prescribed; as, set forms of prayer. ; Adjusted; arranged; formed; adapted.	j:gp,43,3;1ofw,26,4;8yk,25,2;1zf3,6,7;rxc,5,1;29lz,4,5;10gu,3,6;22wi,0,18~22wi,0,18;1zf3,6,7;10gu,3,6;29lz,4,5;1ofw,26,4;gp,43,3;8yk,25,2;rxc,5,1	e:18yb,0,3~18yb,0,3
